r-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">June 18, 1999<br/>Beta 5.0</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20170930161739&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Pile_of_Bones_7ecce8.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a pile of bones <span class=\"p-attributes\">(Vol:10)</span>.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 100.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>This item can be found in several places around <a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia\">Tibia</a>. There is a daily spawn in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Fibula%20Dungeon\">Fibula Dungeon</a> and there are a lot of these in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Alchemist%20Quarter\">Alchemist Quarter</a> and under the <a href=\"#/wiki/Necromant%20House\">Necromant House</a>. Looks the same as a recently Slain <a href=\"#/wiki/Skeleton\">Skeleton</a>, but it does not disappear, making it a fine decoration for <a href=\"#/wiki/Halloween\">Halloween</a>. You cannot equip this item on your backpack slot.<br/>Looks the same as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Pile%20of%20Bones%20%28Quest%29\">Pile of Bones (Quest)</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\